# **African Drumming Classes at The j Noosa**

[![the j](/media/2014/03/the-j.jpg)](/media/2014/03/the-j.jpg) Yay! The time has come! Classes will begin at The j in Noosa after the Easter Break. Be sure to book your space.  These classes will run in 5 week blocks starting April 28th.  We look forward to giving our students a closer class option.  For those that live in and around Noosa or know friends that do, please share this event. We need your support!! The J - Noosa 60 Noosa Dr, Noosa Heads QLD 4567 5 week course starting April 28th - May 26t Mondays 6-7pm Ph 0434585992 or email info@rhythmculture.com.au Purchase course [here](/shop-2/drumming-classes/5-drumming-classes-sunshine-coast/ "Noosa drumming course bookings") Keep updated with event [here](https://www.facebook.com/events/677739842267500/ "Noosa class Facebook page")
